OL,3,GNEWSA'Confident' driver jailed after
OL,4,Ahead-on crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who left a woman with serious
OL,7,Finjuries after a head-on crash has been
OL,8,Fjailed for two years and four months.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Police said Robert Browne
OL,11,Fwas overtaking three cars "in poor
OL,12,Fweather conditions" on the A517 near
OL,13,FHulland on 5 December 2024 when he
OL,14,Fcrashed into a car coming the other
OL,15,Fway.
OL,17,FA police statement said he had been
OL,18,Fdriving at about 60mph (96.56km/h) on
OL,19,Fthe opposite side of the road when he
OL,20,Flost control of his car on a corner and
OL,21,Fcollided head on with a vehicle
OL,22,Ftravelling in the opposite direction.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
